action&quot;:2,&quot;action_parameters&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:&quot;romanian&quot;},&quot;beta&quot;:false},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Русский (Russian)&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/landing/1000000?l=russian&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:2,&quot;action_parameters&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:&quot;russian&quot;},&quot;beta&quot;:false},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Suomi (Finnish)&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/landing/1000000?l=finnish&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:2,&quot;action_parameters&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:&quot;finnish&quot;},&quot;beta&quot;:false},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Svenska (Swedish)&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/landing/1000000?l=swedish&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:2,&quot;action_parameters&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:&quot;swedish&quot;},&quot;beta&quot;:false},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Türkçe (Turkish)&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/landing/1000000?l=turkish&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:2,&quot;action_parameters&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:&quot;turkish&quot;},&quot;beta&quot;:false},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Tiếng Việt (Vietnamese)&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/landing/1000000?l=vietnamese&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:2,&quot;action_parameters&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:&quot;vietnamese&quot;},&quot;beta&quot;:false},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Українська (Ukrainian)&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/landing/1000000?l=ukrainian&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:2,&quot;action_parameters&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:&quot;ukrainian&quot;},&quot;beta&quot;:false}]}]}],&quot;bIsAdmin&quot;:false,&quot;primaryPublisherName&quot;:&quot;Redacted&quot;,&quot;disableLoginButton&quot;:false}}\"></div>\n\t<link href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/css/../javascript/partnermenu/partnermenu.css?v=Nkvys1E2zLc5&amp;l=english&amp;_cdn=akamai\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/javascript/partnermenu/partnermenu.js?v=H_GcgOP3wgQQ&amp;l=english&amp;_cdn=akamai\"></script>\n\n\n\t<div class=\"AdminPageContent\">\n\n\t\t<div id=\"landingWelcome\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com\">Steamworks</a> &gt;\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/\">App Admin</a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div><img class=\"capsule\" src=\"\"> </div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"appName\">ExampleGame (1000000)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"color: #888888; float: right;\">Game</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"releaseProgressContainer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"releaseProgressTitleCtn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"mainTitle iconLink icon_release\">Release Progress:</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"releaseTitleDescription\">Follow the instructions and checklists below to prepare for release. Your store page and game build may be worked on in any order.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/store/releasing\" class=\"docLink btnv6_lightblue_blue btn_medium\"><span>See documentation</span></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"releaseStepsCtn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"releaseStep\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"stepState\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"title\">Store Presence</span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In order to post a store page, you will need to complete the following:</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Complete the checklist below.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Submit your store page for review. If the review identifies any issues that require a fix, additional review will be necessary. Please allow 2-3 business days per review.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"StatusCtn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Checklist incomplete:</span> <a href=\"#StoreChecklist\" class=\"seeChecklist\">See checklist below</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"releaseStep\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"stepState\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"title\">Game Build</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In order to release your game and make it playable for customers, you will need to complete the following:</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Upload a playable build. <span>(For review, your build should be completely playable and contain all features described on your store page, but it's fine if there are still bugs. You can update anytime during and after review)</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Complete the checklist below.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Submit your build for review. Please allow 3-5 business days per review. <span>(If the review identifies any issues that require a fix, additional review will be necessary.)</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"StatusCtn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Checklist incomplete:</span> <a href=\"#BuildChecklist\" class=\"seeChecklist\">See checklist below</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"releaseStep\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"stepState\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"title\">Release</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Once you've completed the following steps, you will be able to release your game here:</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Store page and game build have been reviewed and approved.</li>\n\n                                        \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    <li>Store page has been visible as 'Coming Soon' for at least two weeks.</li>\n                                        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"StatusCtn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Your earliest possible release is two weeks after your store page has been visible as 'Coming Soon'. Please plan accordingly.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<br>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"landingRightCol\">\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"panel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div  data-featuretarget=\"storeadmin-releasedateinfo\" data-props=\"{&quot;unAppID&quot;:1000000,&quot;rtReleaseDate&quot;:null,&quot;strComingSoonDisplay&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;rgEarliestAdvancedAccessDate&quot;:0}\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sectionTitle_small\">App Release State:</div>\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grey\">Unavailable <span class=\"ttip small\"  data-tooltip-text=\"App not playable/useable by customers. Please set your intended release date and mark your app as ready for review once your checklist is complete.\" >(?)</span></h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t                                    <div class=\"sectionTitle_small\">Launch Discount: <span class=\"ttip\"  data-tooltip-text=\"Optional. If set, we will apply a discount of this amount to your game at launch. The discount can be configured to run for between 7 and 14 days.\"  >(?)</span></div>\n                    <h2>None                            \t                    <a class=\"iconLink icon_edit icon_inline\" style=\"background-position-x: center\" title=\"Change\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"showModal('LaunchDiscountModal'); return false;\"></a>                                                                    </h2>\n                \n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel checklist incomplete\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a name=\"StoreChecklist\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"iconLink icon_check_gold_unchecked\">Your Store Presence</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span id=\"checklist_incomplete_title\" style=\"color: #e1c48a\">Checklist incomplete</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Required items for listing as “Coming Soon” as well as for full release.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><div class=\"sectionTitle_small\"><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/edit/2000000\">Store</a> <span class=\"ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Your app's presence on the Steam store\">(?)</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"release_checklist_table\"><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_basic\">Basic Info</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to set your application name, platforms, supported languages, and genres in the store admin\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_complete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_checked\">✔</div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_description\">Descriptions</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to set your description and short description in the store admin\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/contentdescriptors/editsurvey/1000000\">Content Survey</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You must complete the Content Survey. Click 'Content Survey' under the Store Presence section.\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td>Planned Release Date <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"A future release date must be picked by clicking 'update' next to 'Date Not Set' above\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_basic#SysReqs\">System Requirements</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to define at least minimum system requirements for your product in the store page admin\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_basic#controller\">Controller Support Description</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to fill out controller information for your game, even if the info is that controllers are unsupported\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_graphicalassets&subtab=screenshots\">5 Or More Screenshots</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to upload 5 or more screenshots on the graphical assets tab in the store page admin\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_graphicalassets&subtab=store\">Capsule Images</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to upload all store capsule images. Check the Graphical assets tab for details on requirements.\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_graphicalassets&subtab=library\">Library Assets</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to upload the library hero, logo, and capsule images.  These are available in the Store admin, under Graphical Assets => Library Assets.\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_basic#supportInfo\">Support Info</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You must fill out at least one of the support contact methods on the basic info tab in your app\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_basic\">Developer and Publisher Names</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You must specify the developer and publisher of your game\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_basic#genre_form\">Store Page Descriptive Tags</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You must apply at least 5 tags to describe your game. Click the link to do this now.\">?</a></td></tr></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><div class=\"sectionTitle_small\"><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/view/1000000\">Community</a> <span class=\"ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Your app's presence on Steam community. Click 'Edit Steamworks Settings' to the left in order to configure these options.\">(?)</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"release_checklist_table\"><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/clientimages/1000000\">App Icon</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to upload an App Icon on the Installation Client Images tab in the Steamworks Settings admin\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/clientimages/1000000\">Shortcut Icon</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to upload a Client Shortcut .ico file on the Installation Client Images tab in the Steamworks Settings admin\">?</a></td></tr></table>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"optionalChecks\">These items are strongly recommended, but not required. If you integrate one of these features, you should also select the corresponding tick-box in your store page info under 'Supported Features'.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sectionTitle_small\">Recommended Items</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"release_checklist_table\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"checklist_suggested\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_suggested\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/cloud/1000000\">Cloud Saves</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Allows user save files to follow them across PCs\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_suggested\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_suggested\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/achievements/1000000\">Steam Achievements</a>  <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Add achievements to your game\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_suggested\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_suggested\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_basic#accessibility\">Accessibility features</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"If your app has any accessibility features, please complete the Accessibility Features Wizard in the Edit Store, Basic Info tab.\">?</a></td></tr></table>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel checklist incomplete\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a name=\"BuildChecklist\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"iconLink icon_check_gold_unchecked\">Your Game Build</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span id=\"checklist_incomplete_title\" style=\"color: #e1c48a\">Checklist incomplete</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This checklist, in addition to the one above, should serve as a list of the minimum work items to prepare your application for release on Steam. For a more comprehensive view of preparing for release on Steam, please see the <a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/gettingstarted\">Step-by-Step guide</a>.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><div class=\"sectionTitle_small\"><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/edit/2000000\">Store</a> <span class=\"ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Your app's presence on the Steam store\">(?)</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"release_checklist_table\"><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td>Platform Support Matches <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Your store display and Steamworks configuration need to show the same set of supported platforms\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td>Pricing For At Least One Package <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Click the link for 'Adjust pricing' on one or more of the store packages listed above to propose pricing.\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td>Published Pricing For At Least One Package <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Click the link for 'Adjust pricing' on one or more of the store packages listed above to publish reviewed pricing.\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/editbyappid/1000000?activetab=tab_movies\">Trailer Uploaded</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You must upload at least one trailer of your product on the trailers tab in the store page admin\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_complete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_checked\">✔</div></td><td>App Configuration <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Store and Steamworks types for this app match. This should always be complete. If not, please contact us using the Support link at the top of the Steamworks site.\">?</a></td></tr></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><div class=\"sectionTitle_small\"><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/depots/1000000\">Depots</a> <span class=\"ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Depots contain the app that is distributed to customers on Steam\">(?)</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"release_checklist_table\"><tr class=\"checklist_complete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_checked\">✔</div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/depots/1000000\">At Least One Depot Configured</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to have at least one depot set up in the depot section of the Steamworks settings\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_incomplete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_unchecked\"></div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/builds/1000000\">At Least One Build Configured</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to have a build set as the default public build in the builds tab of the Steamworks settings\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_complete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_checked\">✔</div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/config/1000000\">Launch Options Defined</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to define the executable file Steam should run when users try to launch your application\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_complete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_checked\">✔</div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/config/1000000\">Install Directory Set</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"You need to set an install directory for your content. You can do this on the 'General Installation' page in the Steamworks settings.\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_complete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_checked\">✔</div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/depots/1000000#language_form\">Depot Languages Configured</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Your app must have at least one depot that is not language specific OR contain a depot for every language.\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_complete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_checked\">✔</div></td><td>Store And Devcomp Packages Match <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"For release testing, your devcomp package must contain the same depots as your store package\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_complete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_checked\">✔</div></td><td>Package Includes Windows Depot <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"Your app claims to support Windows but does not include a depot for this platform.\">?</a></td></tr><tr class=\"checklist_complete\"><td class=\"checkbox_ctn\"><div class=\"checklist_box_checked\">✔</div></td><td><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/depots/1000000\">All Depots Attached</a> <a class=\"ttip small checklist_ttip\" data-tooltip-text=\"All defined depots need to be attached to packages.\">?</a></td></tr></table></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Region Restrictions</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tNeed to modify your app's region restrictions? <a href=\"https://help.steampowered.com/wizard/HelpWithPublishing?issueid=901&contact=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Contact us</a> to request changes.\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Operating System Support</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sectionSubtitle\">The supported operating systems specified in the Steamworks backend and on your store page should match.</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text_orange\">Not in sync!</span>\t\t\t\t\t<br>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sectionTitle_small platform\">In Steamworks:</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"platform_holder\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/view/1000000\">(Edit)</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<br>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sectionTitle_small platform\">In Store Admin:</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"platform_holder\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/images/landing/platform_windows.png\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/edit/2000000\">(Edit)</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"panel\">\n\t\t\t\t<h1>Steamworks user access</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"iconLink icon_users \" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/pub/home/900000\">Manage users and permissions</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Add or remove users that can view and edit this application.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"landingLeftCol\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title2\">Store Packages, Pricing, &amp; Release Dates</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"titleHelper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/store/application/packages\">See Package Documentation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<br clear=\"left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grayRule\"> </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"descriptor\">These are the current, active, or future packages that might allow users to purchase or install this application.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"landingTable appLandingStorePackagesCtn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tr\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"th\">Package Title</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"th\">Release date <span class=\"ttip\"  data-tooltip-text=\"The Release Date is not set until the app has been released. Date is not typically set here at all for free products.\"  >(?)</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"th\">State <span class=\"ttip\"  data-tooltip-text=\"Release state is 'hidden' until the app is made playable. For free apps, this state will remain as 'hidden' even after release.\"  >(?)</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"th\">Price <span class=\"ttip\"  data-tooltip-text=\"This will display the current active pricing for the title.\"  >(?)</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"th\">Active discount</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"th\" style=\"width: 80px;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tr hidden\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/store/packagelanding/1857241\" class=\"td\">ExampleGame - 1857241 </a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"td\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"td\">Hidden</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"td\">No pricing approved<br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"td\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"td controls\"><a class=\"icon\" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/packages/pricing/1857241\"  data-tooltip-text=\"View and adjust pricing\" ><img src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/images/landing/icon_cost.svg\"></a><a class=\"icon\" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/packages/discounts/1857241\"  data-tooltip-text=\"See discount history\" ><img src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/images/landing/icon_discount.svg\"></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>View Associated Items</h2>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_associated\" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/associated/1000000\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAll Associated Packages, DLC, Demos And Tools.<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Manage store, product key and promotional packages. Add DLC, demos and tools.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Store Presence</h2>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_edit \" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/admin/game/edit/2000000\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEdit Store Page<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Edit the description, add screenshots, trailers, art assets, etc.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_store\" href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1000000?beta=0\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tView Store Page <img src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/images/Documentation/ico_external_link.gif\" border=\"0\" align=\"bottom\"><br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tView this application as it currently exists on the Steam store.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t( <span class=\"ttip\"  data-tooltip-text=\"Preview your storepage, including any pending changes that are not yet public.\" >\t\t\t\t<script>\n\t\t\t\t\tfunction FollowTransferLink0()\n\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\tvar form = $J('<form />', { action: \"https://store.steampowered.com/login/transfer\", method: \"GET\", style: 'display: none;', target: '_blank' } );\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tform.append( $J('<input />', { type: 'hidden', name: \"steamid\", value: \"76561190000000001\" } ) );\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tform.append( $J('<input />', { type: 'hidden', name: \"auth\", value: \"ffffffffffffffffffffffffffff0008\" } ) );\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tform.append( $J('<input />', { type: 'hidden', name: \"redirect\", value: \"app/1000000?beta=1\" } ) );\n\t\t\t\t\t\tform.appendTo('body').submit();\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t</script>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"betaLink\" onclick=\"javascript:FollowTransferLink0(); return false;\">View in Beta mode</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span> )\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_edit\" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/contentdescriptors/editsurvey/1000000/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tContent Survey<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Fill out a survey describing your product. This is required before release.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Technical Tools</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_steamworks \" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/view/1000000\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\tEdit Steamworks Settings<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Define Achievements, manage Workshop, upload Trading Card assets, etc.</span>\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_key \" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/packages/1000000/\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\tRequest Steam Product Keys<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Request keys to distribute your application wherever you like</span>\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_error \" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/errors/viewbuild/1000000/0/\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\tView Errors<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">See errors logged via Steam for this application</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section\" id=\"marketingtools\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Marketing Tools & Data</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_marketing\" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/navtrafficstats/1000000\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMarketing &amp; Visibility<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Track and manage the marketing and visibility for your app.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_curator disabled\" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/curators/manage/1000000\"  data-tooltip-text=\"To access Curator Connect, you need to have 'Generate CD Keys' permission and app needs to have a publicly visible store page.\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCurator Connect<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Send copies of your Game directly to press, streamers, reviewers, and influencers.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Community Presence</h2>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_cards disabled\" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/communityitems/1000000\" >\n\t\t\t\t\tSteam Community Items<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Configure Badges, Trading Cards, Backgrounds and Emoticons</span>\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_achievements \" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/achievements/1000000\" >\n\t\t\t\t\tAchievements<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Define Achievements for your game</span>\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_cloud \" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/apps/cloud/1000000\" >\n\t\t\t\t\tConfigure Cloud Saves<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Configure Steam to back up and sync user save files</span>\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Financial Access <span class=\"ttip\"  data-tooltip-text=\"Access to sales data is granted only after the game is made available for sale on Steam.\" >(?)</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_finances \" href=\"https://partner.steampowered.com/app/details/1000000/\" >\n\t\t\t\t\tView Sales & Activations Reports<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">See unit sales, key activations, and user data for this application</span>\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Community & Moderation</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_community\" href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/1000000/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tView Community Hub<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">See this game's presence in the Steam Community. Screenshots, Videos, Workshop, etc.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_users\" href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/1000000/admin/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCommunity Hub Admin<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Find tools for managing your hub, such as adding user permissions, configuring forums, or managing chat bans.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"buttonRow icon_event\" href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/ogg/1000000/announcements/hidden/\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPost/Manage Events & Announcements<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subText\">Post and manage your events and announcements to players and fans via Steam.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n\t</div>\n\t<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n\t\tvar g_szBaseUrl = 'https://partner.steamgames.com';\n\t\t\t</script>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"LaunchDiscountModal\" class=\"modal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n\t<h2>Set launch discount</h2>\n\t<p>Here you can set a discount to run for the first week your game is available for purchase. Launch discounts are not required.</p>\n\t<p>We generally suggest 10% or 15%, but a launch discount may not be appropriate for every product. There is a maximum of 40%.</p>\n\t<p>Remember: You cannot participate in a seasonal sale event within 30 days of your product launch. Additionally, it's not possible to discount your product for 30 days after any price increase or following the conclusion of a discount.</p>\n\t<p><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/store/pricing\" target=\"_blank\">Please see Discounting Best Practices</a>\t<img src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/images/Documentation/ico_external_link.gif\" border=\"0\" align=\"bottom\" alt=\"Opens link in a new window\"> </p>\n\n\t<div class=\"inlineLabel\">Discount percentage</div>\n\t<input class=\"inlineLabel\" oninput=\"if( this.value > 40 ) { alert('Value cannot exceed 40%'); this.value = 40; }\" name=\"launch_discount_value\" id=\"launch_discount_value\" value=\"0\">\n\t<div class=\"inlineLabel\">Discount length</div>\n\t<select class=\"inlineLabel\" name=\"launch_discount_days\" id=\"launch_discount_days\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<option selected value=\"7\">7</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t<option  value=\"8\">8</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t<option  value=\"9\">9</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t<option  value=\"10\">10</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t<option  value=\"11\">11</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t<option  value=\"12\">12</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t<option  value=\"13\">13</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t<option  value=\"14\">14</option>\n\t\t\t</select>\n\t<div style=\"text-align: right\">\n\t\t<a class=\"btn_grey_white_innerfade btn_medium\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"hideModal('LaunchDiscountModal'); return false;\"><span>Cancel</span></a>\n\t\t<a class=\"btn_green_white_innerfade btn_medium\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"UpdateReleaseRequest(1000000, { 'launch_discount': $J('#launch_discount_value').val(), 'launch_discount_days': $J('#launch_discount_days').val() }); hideModal('LaunchDiscountModal'); return false\"><span>Update</span></a>\n\t</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"confirm_build_ready_dialog\" class=\"modal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\t<h2 class=\"title_text\">Mark build ready for review</h2>\n\t<div class=\"build_submission_notes newmodal_prompt_with_textarea newmodal_prompt_description\">\n\t\t<p>This will add your build to the queue for review by Valve's review team. You will be notified via e-mail in 3-5 business days with any feedback or with approval to release. Please allow for up to 7 business days to accommodate any changes or fixes necessary as a result of feedback.</p>\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Please ensure you've uploaded a mostly final build of your app and confirm that all launch configuration and depot settings are correct before you submit.</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Your game should be in a playable state, including any necessary servers and microtransaction support.</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Please double-check that your build contains all features as described on your store page.</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Don't worry about bugs or crashes; you are free to continue updating your game build during and after review.</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t<p>You may leave notes below to help expedite testing time consuming or difficult to find features like microtransactions, or provide testing account credentials to third party login servers.</p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<textarea class=\"multiline_text\" id=\"confirm_build_ready_dialog_textarea\"></textarea>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div style=\"text-align: right\">\n\t\t<button class=\"btn_grey_white_innerfade btn_medium\" onclick=\"hideModal('confirm_build_ready_dialog'); return false;\"><span>Cancel</span></button>\n\t\t<button class=\"btn_green_white_innerfade btn_medium\" onclick=\"MarkBuildReadyForReview()\"><span>Update</span></button>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n\t.alertRow {\n\t\tdisplay: block;\n\t\tbackground-position: 8px 13px;\n\t\tbackground-repeat: no-repeat;\n\t\tpadding: 5px 5px 5px 35px;\n\t\tcolor: #e7e8e9;\n\t\tfont-size: 12px;\n\t\tmargin: 1px 0;\n\t\ttext-decoration: none;\n\t}\n\n</style>\n\n<div id=\"CommercialModal\" style=\"display: none; padding: 20px;\">\n\t<form name=\"create_commercial_modal_form\" onsubmit=\"return false;\">\n\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"sessionid\" value=\"ffffffffffffffffffff0001\" />\t\t<div class=\"Modal\">\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"CommercialCloneModal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"aldengold\">Would you like to create a commercial package from an existing Steam package?</p>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Select a Steam package from the list below to use as a template for your new commercial package. The commercial package will be created with the same content and configurations as the source package.</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"alertRow icon_error\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>IMPORTANT: Commercial packages function differently from regular Steam packages. Please make sure you have read and understood the information in <a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/sitelicense/publisher\">this FAQ</a> before publishing a commmercial package.</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div><br>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"landingTable\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"th\">Package Title</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"th\">Release date <span class=\"ttip\"  data-tooltip-text=\"The Release Date is not set until the app has been released. Date is not typically set here at all for free products.\"  >(?)</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"th\">Price <span class=\"ttip\"  data-tooltip-text=\"This will display the current active pricing for the title.\"  >(?)</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"th\">&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"CommercialSelectModal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"aldengold\">What type of commercial license would you like to create?</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We currently have the following two commercial license options available:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>One-time purchase: This allows businesses to purchase commercial licenses of your title for a single upfront fee. For this option we recommend pricing be set at the same price as the regular end user version of your application.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Monthly recurring subscription: This option results in an up front charge for each license followed by an ongoing monthly fee per license. For this option we recommend pricing the initial purchase and ongoing subscription at the same price as the regular end user version of your application.<br>Note: The recurring option will create two store packages (one for the initial purchase and one for the monthly recurring charge). You will need to set pricing for both.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>After you create the license, it will be visible on this page. You will need to add pricing to it and once that pricing has been approved, you will then have an option to release it and make it visible on the store.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"alertRow icon_error\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>IMPORTANT: Commercial packages function differently from regular Steam packages. Please make sure you have read and understood the information in <a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/sitelicense/publisher\">this FAQ</a> before publishing a commmercial package.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" value=\"14\" name=\"EBillingType\" id=\"Commercial_OneTime\" checked><label>One-time purchase</label><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"CommercialLicenseModal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>Before creating a commercial license, you will need to sign the Steam Cafe Distribution Addendum to the Steam Distribution Agreement.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</form>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"ShowRemoveItemListingsDialog\" class=\"modal\" style=\"display: none; padding: 20px;\">\n\t<h2>Remove item listings</h2>\n\t<p>Remove all item listings for this application?</p>\n\n\t<div style=\"text-align: right\">\n\t\t<a class=\"btn_grey_white_innerfade btn_medium\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"hideModal('ShowRemoveItemListingsDialog'); return false;\"><span>Cancel</span></a>\n\t\t<a class=\"btn_green_white_innerfade btn_medium\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"if( RemoveItemListings() ) hideModal('ShowRemoveItemListingsDialog'); return false\"><span>OK</span></a>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"ShowRemoveItemBucketsDialog\" class=\"modal\" style=\"display: none; padding: 20px;\">\n\t<h2>Remove item buckets</h2>\n\t<p>Remove all item buckets for this application?</p>\n\n\t<div style=\"text-align: right\">\n\t\t<a class=\"btn_grey_white_innerfade btn_medium\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"hideModal('ShowRemoveItemBucketsDialog'); return false;\"><span>Cancel</span></a>\n\t\t<a class=\"btn_green_white_innerfade btn_medium\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"if( RemoveItemBuckets() ) hideModal('ShowRemoveItemBucketsDialog'); return false\"><span>OK</span></a>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<!-- Footer -->\n<div class=\"responsive_footer_ctn\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"footer_confidentiality_ctn\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Valve Confidential</h2>\n\t\t\t<p>This restricted access page contains Valve confidential information. You must have a non-disclosure and/or license agreement covering confidential information with Valve to use or access this page.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"responsive_footer_content\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"footer_content_left\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/images/steamworks_logo_white.png\" class=\"logo\" />\n\t\t\t<div class=\"steamworks_desc\" >Steamworks is the set of tools and services built by <a href=\"https://www.valvesoftware.com\">Valve</a> that help you configure, manage, and operate your game on <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/\">Steam</a>.</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"corporate\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.valvesoftware.com\"><img src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/images/valve_logo_white_small.png\" /></a><span class=\"vr\"></span><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/\"><img src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/images/steam_logo_white_small.png\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"footer_content_right\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li><em>Documentation</em></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/\">Home</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/gettingstarted\">Getting Started</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/store\">Store Presence</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/features\">Features</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/finance\">Finance</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/marketing\">Sales & Marketing</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/sdk\">Steamworks SDK</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/pccafe\">Café Licensing</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/features/steamvr/info\">Steam VR</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li><em>Resources</em></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/vrlicensing\">Steam VR</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/pccafe\">Steam PC Café Program</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/groups/steamworks/discussions\">Steamworks Discussions <i class=\"icoExternal\"></i></a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/SteamworksDev\">Steamworks Video Tutorials <i class=\"icoExternal\"></i></a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li> <a href=\"http://twitter.com/Steamworks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com//public/shared/images/ico/ico_twitter.png\" alt=\"X: @Steamworks\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\">|</span><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/partner.steamgames.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com//public/shared/images/ico/ico_bsky.png\" alt=\"Bluesky: Steamworks\"></a></li>\n\t\t\t    <li> <a class=\"header_login_btn footerbtn\" href=\"https://help.steampowered.com/en/wizard/HelpWithPublishing\"><span>Contact Support </span></a></li>\n            </ul>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li><em>News & Updates</em></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/news/group/4145017\">Steamworks Blog <i class=\"icoExternal\"></i></a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/593110\">Steam Blog <i class=\"icoExternal\"></i></a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/250820\">Steam VR Blog <i class=\"icoExternal\"></i></a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1675200\">Steam Deck Blog <i class=\"icoExternal\"></i></a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n\t</script>\n<div id=\"application_config\" style=\"display: none;\"  data-config=\"{&quot;EUNIVERSE&quot;:1,&quot;WEB_UNIVERSE&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;LANGUAGE&quot;:&quot;english&quot;,&quot;COUNTRY&quot;:&quot;TR&quot;,&quot;MEDIA_CDN_COMMUNITY_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/community_assets\\/&quot;,&quot;MEDIA_CDN_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/&quot;,&quot;VIDEO_CDN_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/&quot;,&quot;COMMUNITY_CDN_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/community.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/&quot;,&quot;COMMUNITY_CDN_ASSET_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/appmgmt\\/&quot;,&quot;STORE_CDN_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/store.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/&quot;,&quot;PUBLIC_SHARED_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/store.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/public\\/shared\\/&quot;,&quot;COMMUNITY_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/steamcommunity.com\\/&quot;,&quot;CHAT_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/steamcommunity.com\\/&quot;,&quot;STORE_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/store.steampowered.com\\/&quot;,&quot;STORE_CHECKOUT_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/checkout.steampowered.com\\/&quot;,&quot;IMG_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/partner.steamgames.com\\/public\\/images\\/&quot;,&quot;STEAMTV_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/steam.tv\\/&quot;,&quot;HELP_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/help.steampowered.com\\/&quot;,&quot;PARTNER_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/partner.steamgames.com\\/&quot;,&quot;STATS_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/partner.steampowered.com\\/&quot;,&quot;INTERNAL_STATS_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/steamstats.valve.org\\/&quot;,&quot;IN_CLIENT&quot;:false,&quot;USE_POPUPS&quot;:false,&quot;STORE_ICON_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/store_item_assets\\/steam\\/apps\\/&quot;,&quot;STORE_ITEM_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/store_item_assets\\/&quot;,&quot;WEBAPI_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/api.steampowered.com\\/&quot;,&quot;TOKEN_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/partner.steamgames.com\\/chat\\/clientjstoken&quot;,&quot;BUILD_TIMESTAMP&quot;:1790970958,&quot;PAGE_TIMESTAMP&quot;:1790992910,&quot;IN_TENFOOT&quot;:false,&quot;IN_CHROMEOS&quot;:false,&quot;IN_MOBILE_WEBVIEW&quot;:false,&quot;PLATFORM&quot;:&quot;windows&quot;,&quot;BASE_URL_STORE_CDN_ASSETS&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/store\\/&quot;,&quot;EREALM&quot;:1,&quot;LOGIN_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/login.steampowered.com\\/&quot;,&quot;AVATAR_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/avatars.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/&quot;,&quot;FROM_WEB&quot;:true,&quot;WEBSITE_ID&quot;:&quot;Partner&quot;,&quot;BASE_URL_SHARED_CDN&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/&quot;,&quot;CLAN_CDN_ASSET_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/clan.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/&quot;,&quot;COMMUNITY_ASSETS_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\\/community_assets\\/&quot;,&quot;NOW&quot;:1790992910,&quot;SUPPORT_BASE_URL&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/steamsupport.valvesoftware.com\\/&quot;,&quot;SNR&quot;:&quot;100600_apps_landing_&quot;}\" data-userinfo=\"{&quot;logged_in&quot;:true,&